{
  "id": "gov.works",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "Works / WAMS project lifecycle",
    "hi": "निर्माण कार्य / डब्ल्यूएएमएस परियोजना जीवनचक्र"
  },
  "domain": "Works / WAMS",
  "description": "Estimate scrutiny, technical sanction then administrative approval with budget encumbrance (chained sanctions; the order is per tenant / department configuration, works-config), tender, work order, monthly measurement-book cycle with check measurement and running bills paid through P1, cumulative-threshold revised AA, amendments (variation, EoT, LD, price escalation) applied to the running case, final bill, completion, defect liability period and release of the performance security (D-WORKS).",
